# Seolleyeon Docker build context filter (allowlist).
# Shared by BOTH repo-root-context builds:
#   - recsys pipeline        (Dockerfile = recsys/Dockerfile)
#   - avatar worker          (Dockerfile = lib/ai_recommend_model/avatar_generation/Dockerfile)
# Every COPY source of both Dockerfiles must survive this filter.
# Regression lock: tests/test_avatar_build_context.py (Cloud Build 4cd9b850
# failed on 2026-08-30 because the avatar entries below were missing).

# Exclude everything first
*

# Include recsys pipeline code
!recsys
!recsys/**
!lib
!lib/ai_recommend_model
!lib/ai_recommend_model/*.py

# Include avatar worker build context
!lib/ai_recommend_model/avatar_generation
!lib/ai_recommend_model/avatar_generation/**
!requirements_avatar_worker.txt
